    <item>
      <title>科学家利用高温熔盐将普通塑料垃圾转化为燃料 有望降低回收成本</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/climate/post/20260913/%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E9%AB%98%E6%B8%A9%E7%86%94%E7%9B%90%E5%B0%86%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E5%A1%91%E6%96%99%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%BA%E7%87%83%E6%96%99-%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%9B%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%E5%9B%9E%E6%94%B6%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC/</link>
